--- !u!114 &1253811530
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1253811529}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f25bf7b3879a546b58bdfe2c2482afb7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  line: "It began as fatigue: sleepless nights, quiet breakdowns, the slow dissaperance
    of joy.\nWithin a decade, emotional instability had reached epidemic levels.\nAnxiety,
    depression, and dissociation spread faster than any virus.\nOne in every three
    citizens reported suicidal thoughts. Entire cities simply stopped functioning.\nGovernments
    declared a global psychological emergency. The economy collapsed under the weight
    of collective despair.\nIn response, the EMPATH Rehabilitation Center was founded
    - a sanctuary for emotional recovery through adaptive AI therapy.\nPatients were
    promised balance, clarity, and peace. \nSome people among society have been selected
    for the try out."
  voice: ballad
  model: gpt-4o-mini-tts
